id: pm-gh1713
title: "GH-1713: strict create offers no auditable deferred value, so importers cannot create an item whose deadline, assignee or acceptance criteria are not known yet"
description: "GH-1713 (filed 2026-11-12). Under the strict preset, strict create requires concrete values for deadline, assignee and acceptance criteria and refuses every way of saying a value is not known yet: the repeatable options accept an explicit clear, but the three required scalars refuse --unset and accept no deferred value. An importer that mirrors records from another system (pm-github gated issue sync, Linear, ADO or CSV importers) must either fail or invent a deadline and an assignee. pm-github runs its sync inside one atomic import, so in a strict tracker every new GitHub issue fails strict create and the whole daily sync rolls back; one fleet repository has failed this way on every run for 19 days (importer side tracked in unbraind/pm-github issue 237). Proposed direction from the issue: an explicit, auditable deferred state for strict-required scalars on create, never a silent bypass. A typed marker or a defer option with a reason (CLI and SDK create options), recorded in history; pm health and pm validate list deferred fields as curation work; strict close still requires concrete values so a deferral never lets incomplete work finish; optionally the deferral is allowed only for items with external provenance or for callers that declare an import capability."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[5]: "gh:1713",governance,importers,sdk,strict-preset
created_at: "2026-11-12T21:09:20.732Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-12T23:23:56.703Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Strict create accepts an explicit deferral for deadline, assignee and acceptance criteria with a reason, through the CLI and the SDK create options; The deferral is recorded in history and pm validate and pm health list deferred fields as curation work; Strict close still requires concrete values for every deferred field; A strict-preset importer run creates items without inventing values and the pm-github sync no longer rolls back"
parent: pm-33cw
